		'''
	GsNecroArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		遠距離クリティカル率が10%上昇
		遠距離攻撃時、20%の確率で貫通する骨を投げ、敵を倒すと3本の骨を放出する
		'''
	GsJungleArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		マナ消費量が16%減少
		魔法攻撃が胞子を残して敵を毒状態にし、胞子が命中するたびマナを2回復する
		'''
	GsBeeArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		召喚ダメージが10%増加
		3匹の巨大なハチが周囲を旋回して近くの敵を刺し、攻撃してきた敵へ一斉に攻撃する
		'''
	GsObsidianArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		召喚ダメージとムチの攻撃速度が15%、ムチの射程が30%増加する
		ヘルストーンとメテオライトの上を歩けるようになる
		ムチが敵に黒曜石の刻印を3秒間付与し、ミニオンは刻印された敵に追加で4固定ダメージを与える
		'''
	GsMoltenArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		近接ダメージが10%増加し、炎上を無効化、近接攻撃が敵を炎上させる
		6回近接攻撃するごとに対象の足元から溶岩の炎柱を噴き上げる
		'''
	// Hardmode ores: the helmet's vanilla class set bonus stays, one metal property is layered on top
	GsCobaltArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		ヘルメットのクラスセットボーナスはそのまま発動する
		5秒間ダメージを受けずにいると迅影を獲得する：移動速度が8%上昇、5回攻撃するごとにコバルトの幻影の刃を放つ
		'''
	GsPalladiumArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		敵を攻撃すると高速ライフ自然回復を獲得する
		同じ敵を6回攻撃するとオーブを放ち、敵に噛みついた後、自身へ戻って8回復する
		'''
	GsMythrilArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		ヘルメットのクラスセットボーナスはそのまま発動する
		8回攻撃するごとにミスリルの精霊の剣を生み出し、対象へ向かって突進させる
		'''
	GsOrichalcumArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		攻撃命中時に花びらが降る
		同じ敵に命中した5枚目の花びらは2枚の追加の追尾する花びらに分裂する
		'''
	GsTitaniumArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		敵を攻撃するとチタニウムバリアを獲得する
		周囲を回る破片が増えるほど、最大でクリティカル率が15%、手に持った武器のダメージが10%増加する
		ダメージを受けるとバリアが破壊される
		'''
	GsAdamantiteArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		ヘルメットのクラスセットボーナスはそのまま発動する
		攻撃で熱を最大12スタックまで蓄積し、最大時の次の攻撃でアダマンタイトの残り火を6個放出する
		'''
	// Remaining hardmode and endgame sets
	GsSpiderArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		召喚ダメージが12%増加
		ミニオンの攻撃が20%の確率で敵を2秒間拘束する蜘蛛の糸を吐き出す、ダメージを受けると3本の蜘蛛の糸を放つ
		'''
	GsFrostArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		近接攻撃と遠距離攻撃が凍結を付与し、ダメージが10%増加、フロストバーン、凍え、凍結を無効化
		近接攻撃と遠距離攻撃が20%の確率で対象へつららを落とす
		ダメージを受けると冷気の衝撃を放ち、10秒に1回、周囲の敵を1秒間凍結させる
		'''
	GsCrystalAssassinArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		ダメージとクリティカル率が10%増加し、ダッシュ能力を得る
		敵へダッシュすると、その敵から水晶の欠片を5個放出する
		ダッシュ後の次の3回の攻撃が必ずクリティカルになる
		'''
	GsHallowedArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		聖なる加護は以前と同様に機能する（フードは引き続きミニオンスロットを2つ付与）
		攻撃を回避すると聖なる星を6個放ち、5秒間ダメージとクリティカル率が10%増加する
		'''
	GsBeetleScaleArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		連続攻撃で甲虫の力を最大20スタックまで蓄積し、2秒間攻撃しないとリセットされる
		1スタックごとに近接ダメージが1%、近接攻撃速度が0.5%増加し、最大スタック時は攻撃が20%の確率で対象へ突撃する甲虫を放つ
		'''
	GsBeetleShellArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		ダメージを受けると殻の層を最大3まで獲得する（1スタックごとに防御力が6増加し、ダメージを6%軽減）
		10秒間攻撃を受けないと消滅する
		3スタックある状態でダメージを受けると殻が砕け、攻撃者へ向けて殻の破片を5個放つ
		'''
	GsTurtleArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		ダメージを15%軽減し、近接接触攻撃を行った敵に受けたダメージの2倍を返す
		ダメージを受けると3秒に1回、防御力の2倍の近接ダメージを与える棘を8本放つ
		'''
	GsTikiArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		最大ミニオンスロットが1増加
		召喚ダメージが10%増加
		ムチの射程が20%増加
		ミニオンとムチの攻撃が20%の確率でトーテムの霊炎を呼び出し、敵を追尾して3秒間毒を付与する
		'''
	GsSpectreHoodArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		魔法攻撃で回復オーブを放つが、魔法ダメージが40%減少する
		最大マナが100増加し、マナ自然回復速度が上昇する
		8秒に1回ダメージを受けると40%の確率で最大ライフの10%を回復する
		'''
	GsSpectreMaskArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		魔法攻撃で魂を放ち、マナ消費量が15%減少する
		魔法ダメージとクリティカル率が10%増加する
		魔法クリティカル攻撃が30%の確率で追加の幽炎を放つ
		'''
	GsShroomiteArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		静止中にステルス効果を獲得し、遠距離クリティカル率が15%増加、弾薬を30%の確率で消費しない
		ステルスが最大に近い状態では、遠距離攻撃が30%の確率で追尾する胞子を3発発射するタレットを生成する
		'''
	GsSolarArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		ソーラーシールドを獲得し、ダッシュを使えるようになる
		シールド1枚ごとに防御力が8増加し、ダメージを4%軽減する
		敵へダッシュすると巨大な爆発を発生させる
		'''
	GsVortexArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		ステルス中は弾薬を消費せず、通常時は移動速度が15%、遠距離クリティカル率が10%増加する
		ステルス中、遠距離攻撃が40%の確率で最も近い別の敵へ雷撃を連鎖させる
		'''
	GsNebulaArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		ネビュラブースターによる強化効果を得る
		ブースターのレベルごとに魔法ダメージが5%、ライフ自然回復が2、マナ消費量減少が10%増加する
		魔法攻撃が25%の確率で対象にネビュラの花を咲かせ、2回脈動する
		'''
	GsStardustArmor.SetBonusLine:
		'''
		スターダストガーディアンを召喚する
		最大ミニオンスロットが3増加し、召喚ダメージが15%増加する
		ミニオンの攻撃が20%の確率で対象へ彗星を落とす
		'''
}

GodSmithBoomerangs: {
	GsWoodenBoomerang.Desc:
		'''
		最初の命中後、近くの別の敵へ跳ね返る
		飛行中に右クリックするとカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
	GsEnchantedBoomerang.Desc:
		'''
		往路では減速し、滞空中に星明かりを集め、戻る時に加速する
		滞空の頂点で3つの追尾する星の火花を放ち、それぞれ30%のダメージを与える
		飛行中に右クリックするとカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
	GsFruitcakeChakram.Desc:
		'''
		戻ってくる時に命中すると対象を砂糖衣で覆い、最大3層まで付与する
		霜衣を纏った対象に戻ってくる時に命中すると全ての層を爆発させ、1層につき25%の追加ダメージを発生させる
		飛行中に右クリックするとカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
	GsBloodyMachete.Desc:
		'''
		命中時に出血を付与し、刻印を刻む：同じ対象に3つの刻印を付けると血を解き放つ
		血解きの一撃は40%の追加ダメージを与え、ライフを2回復する
		飛行中に右クリックするとカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
	GsIceBoomerang.Desc:
		'''
		命中時にフロストバーンを付与し、貫通する氷片を2つ飛散させ、それぞれ25%のダメージを与える
		滞空中は凍り付き、冷気の霧を纏う
		飛行中に右クリックするとカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
	GsShroomerang.Desc:
		'''
		滞空の頂点で残留する胞子雲を放ち、内部の敵にダメージを与える
		飛行経路に光る胞子を降らせる
		飛行中に右クリックするとカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
	GsThornChakram.Desc:
		'''
		命中時に対象を毒状態にし、3本の棘を外側へ放ち、それぞれ22%のダメージを与える
		飛行中に右クリックするとカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
	GsCombatWrench.Desc:
		'''
		同じ対象への3回目の命中は強打となり、80%の追加ダメージを与える
		鋼鉄の構造物への強打はさらに25%増加する
		飛行中に右クリックするとカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
	GsFlamarang.Desc:
		'''
		命中するたびに対象を炎上させる
		空中で停止した時に炎の輪へと爆発し、帰路では火種を残す
		飛行中に右クリックするとカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
	GsTrimarang.Desc:
		'''
		空中に最大3つまで存在できる
		飛行中のブーメランが増えるごとに全てのブーメランのダメージが8%増加する
		飛行中に右クリックすると全てのブーメランをカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
	GsFlyingKnife.Desc:
		'''
		攻撃ボタンを長押しするとカーソルに合わせてナイフを操作する
		離すとその場で旋回し、その後一直線に戻ってくる
		飛行中に右クリックするとカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
	GsBananarang.Desc:
		'''
		最大10本まで投擲できる
		命中するたびにバナナが熟し、6%の追加ダメージを与える（最大5スタック）
		飛行中に右クリックすると全てのバナナをカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
	GsLightDisc.Desc:
		'''
		敵に命中すると最も近い別の敵へ最大3回まで跳ねる
		跳ねるたびにダメージが10%減少する
		飛行中に右クリックするとカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
	GsPossessedHatchet.Desc:
		'''
		獲物へ向かって加速し、そのまま食らいついて対象の周囲を旋回する
		斬撃ごとに魂の刻印を付与し、5回目の斬撃で刻印が破裂して150%のダメージを与える
		飛行中に右クリックすると狙う方向を変更できる
		'''
	GsPaladinsHammer.Desc:
		'''
		ハンマーは重い弧を描いて飛ぶ
		飛んでいった先でもう一度上昇し、その後叩き落として範囲ダメージ65%と衝撃波を発生させる
		飛行中に右クリックするとカーソルへ向かって突進させ、その地点で落下させることができる
		'''
	GsSergeantUnitedShield.Desc:
		'''
		投げた後、手元に戻ってくるまでは敵の間を最大4回跳ね返り、跳ね返るたびに強くなる
		受け取ると一瞬だけ防御態勢になり、1回分のダメージを無効化する
		飛行中に右クリックするとカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
	GsAnchor.Desc:
		'''
		重い弧を描いて飛び、頂点を越えると真下へ落下する
		叩き落とすと地面を揺らし、範囲ダメージ60%を与える
		錨が地面に突き刺さった後、鎖を伝って戻ってくる
		飛行中に右クリックすると最初にカーソルへ向かって突進させることができる
		'''
}

GodSmithBows: {
	GsWoodenBow.Desc:
		'''
		長押しで引き絞り、離すと放つ
		半分まで引くと弾速と威力が上がり、最大まで引くと木の精霊の矢になる
		限界まで引き絞った状態で矢を放ち、敵に命中すると、矢が扇状に分裂する
		限界まで引き絞り続けると、威力が最大まで引いた状態に戻り、短時間疲労状態になる
		'''
	GsBorealWoodBow.Desc:
		'''
		3段階まで引き絞ることができ、限界まで引くと矢が分裂する
		限界まで引き絞った状態で矢を放つと、霜を纏い、敵を冷却して一時的に弱い敵の動きを鈍らせる
		'''
	GsPalmWoodBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw, full-draw transmutes, overdraw splits
		Overdrawn arrows fly dry and true, striking vitals more often
		'''
	GsRichMahoganyBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw, full-draw transmutes, overdraw splits
		Many-stemmed vines: overdrawn hits split into one extra arrow
		'''
	GsEbonwoodBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw, full-draw transmutes, overdraw splits
		Overdrawn arrows have a chance to ignite shadowflame
		'''
	GsShadewoodBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw, full-draw transmutes, overdraw splits
		Overdrawn arrows have a chance to open a bleeding wound
		'''
	GsAshWoodBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw, full-draw transmutes, overdraw splits
		Overdrawn arrows set foes alight, scattering cinders
		'''
	GsCopperBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw; full-drawn quenched arrowheads burst into sparks and splash nearby foes
		Overdraw looses one free side arrow
		'''
	GsTinBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw; full-drawn quenched arrowheads burst into sparks and splash nearby foes
		Overdraw looses one free side arrow in a denser spark shower
		'''
	GsIronBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw; full-drawn quenched arrowheads burst into sparks and splash nearby foes
		Overdrawn press arrows: crushing knockback, briefly pinning lesser foes
		'''
	GsLeadBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw; full-drawn quenched arrowheads burst into sparks and splash nearby foes
		Overdrawn press arrows carry lead: the slam pins and poisons
		'''
	GsSilverBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw; full-drawn quenched arrowheads burst into sparks and splash nearby foes
		Overdrawn hallowed arrows ricochet once toward a nearby foe
		'''
	GsTungstenBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw; full-drawn quenched arrowheads burst into sparks and splash nearby foes
		Overdrawn arrows ricochet twice; the final strike bursts
		'''
	GsGoldBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw; full-drawn quenched arrowheads burst into sparks and splash nearby foes
		Overdrawn royal arrows crit more often; critical hits burst into a few copper coins
		'''
	GsPlatinumBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw; full-drawn quenched arrowheads burst into sparks and splash nearby foes
		Overdrawn crown arrows always crit, bursting into more copper coins
		'''
	GsDemonBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw. A full draw transmutes the arrow into a piercing unholy bolt
		An overdrawn hit releases two soul-seeking shadowflame wisps that slowly hunt nearby foes
		'''
	GsTendonBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: three-stage draw. Full-drawn clot arrows open bleeding wounds
		Overdrawn heartstring slam: a heavier shaft with brutal knockback that spatters blood and sips a little life back
		'''
	GsBloodRainBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: arrows still fall as blood rain. Three-stage draw
		A full draw calls four extra bolts onto the cursor; an overdrawn flood calls eight, and the main bolt pools blood where it lands, trampling and slowing foes
		'''
	GsBeesKnees.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: wooden arrows still become bee arrows. Three-stage draw
		Full-drawn hits release two extra bees; an overdrawn hit leaves a swirling bee vortex. At most twelve bees may serve you at once
		'''
	GsHellwingBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: wooden arrows still become wall-piercing hellwings, and the draw is faster
		A full draw looses three bats in a V; an overdrawn draw unleashes six in a spiral that scatters, then converges
		'''
	GsMoltenFury.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: wooden arrows still become flaming arrows. Three-stage draw
		Full-drawn molten cores spray magma beads on impact; an overdrawn volcanic shot calls five molten rain bolts down on the mark
		'''

	GsChargeBleedBuff: {
		DisplayName: Bloodletting
		Description: Bleeding out
	}

	GsDaedalusStormbow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: arrows now fall from the sky, and a silver seal marks each landing point before the bolt strikes
		Shots build storm charge; at full charge the next shot lays a 3x3 sky matrix, corners then edges then center
		The center bolt lands heaviest and bursts on impact.
		Sky bolts stack hunt brands; branding a foe thrice calls a verdict bolt down upon it
		'''
	GsTsunami.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: each draw looses a rank of 5 arrows that surge forward in a rolling wave, one ammo per draw
		Shots build tide charge; at full charge the next draw becomes a great wave: 7 piercing arrows in two ranks led by a sweeping foam crest
		Wave arrows stack tide brands; branding a foe thrice sends a water spout erupting beneath it
		While a branded foe stands, every 4th arrow splits off a tide-chaser that bites toward it
		'''
	GsFairyQueenRangedItem.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: all arrows become twilight lances; each sweep of the bow looses 5 lances along an arc, converging on the cursor
		The 3rd lance of every sweep is the Queen's lance, striking nearly twice as hard
		Shots build twilight; at full charge the next shot blooms into a prismatic fan of 5 lances
		Lance hits stack brands; branding a foe thrice calls twin fae orbs to circle and peck it for 2 seconds
		'''
	GsDD2BetsyBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: each draw looses 5 dragonfire bolts that climb, stall, then dive-bomb the cursor area
		Impacts burst into dragonfire rings; airborne foes take 35% more damage
		Shots build airstrike charge; at full charge the next draw calls a carpet run of 9 bolts along the flight line
		Bolt hits stack flame brands; branding a foe thrice drops one heavy bomb straight onto it
		'''
	GsPhantasm.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: hold to channel; fire rate climbs with frenzy, and the bow splits into phantom after-bows
		At frenzy rank 2 every volley gains two flanking phantom arrows
		Striking the same foe 6 times in a row calls a phantom archer to hover at your back and loose soul bolts alongside you
		Main arrows stack soul brands; branding a foe thrice makes the archer nail it with 4 homing soul bolts
		'''
	GsPearlwoodBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every 5 shots charge a rainbow arc volley, 5 arrows sweeping out one by one, one ammo per volley
		Landing 3 arc arrows on the same foe pops a pearl prism burst
		'''
	GsCobaltRepeater.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every 6th bolt triple-taps; volley charge looses 3 bolts one after another that accelerate in flight, one ammo per volley
		Volley hits brand prey and grant you a short gust of Swiftness
		'''
	GsPalladiumRepeater.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every 6th bolt triple-taps; volley charge looses a 3-bolt line, one ammo per volley
		Branded foes slain restore 2 life; executions restore 5 more
		'''
	GsMythrilRepeater.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every 6th bolt triple-taps; volley charge looses a 4-bolt wedge, one ammo per volley
		The lead volley bolt always crits against branded foes; side bolts gain +8% crit
		'''
	GsOrichalcumRepeater.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every 6th bolt triple-taps; volley charge looses a 4-bolt wedge trailing petals, one ammo per volley
		Volley hits burst into a small petal blast
		'''
	GsAdamantiteRepeater.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every 6th bolt triple-taps; volley charge looses a 5-bolt echelon at x1.5 knockback, one ammo per volley
		The lead volley bolt lands with a crimson shockwave that splashes nearby foes
		'''
	GsTitaniumRepeater.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every 6th bolt triple-taps; volley charge looses a 5-bolt echelon, one ammo per volley
		Volley bolts etch armor: each hit on the same foe adds +2 armor penetration, up to 5 stacks
		'''
	GsHallowedRepeater.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every 6th bolt triple-taps; volley charge looses a 4-bolt cross, one ammo per volley
		Executing a fully branded foe calls down a hallowed star trailing gold
		'''
	GsChlorophyteShotbow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every 6th shot triple-taps; volley charge looses a 6-arrow spore cone, one ammo per volley
		Branded foes take +10% from this bow; execution bursts a spore cloud
		'''
	GsStakeLauncher.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every 6th stake triple-taps; volley charge looses a 3-stake wedge, one ammo per volley
		Stakes pin and brand prey; the executing stake crucifies at x2.3, undead take a further +25%
		Each crucifixion reloads 30 volley charge; silver light gathers at the muzzle when fully charged
		'''
	GsIceBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: volley charge hurls 6 icicles skyward to rain on the cursor, one ammo per volley
		Icicle hits stack frostbrand; at 3 stacks the next icicle shatters into a frost burst
		'''
	GsMarrow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: volley charge looses a 5-bone-arrow cross with +1 pierce, one ammo per volley
		Executing a fully branded foe cages it with 4 converging bone arrows
		'''
	GsShadowflameBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: volley charge looses 3 shadowflame arrows crossing at the cursor, one ammo per volley
		Branded foes struck by any arrow draw a homing shadowflame wisp; execution erupts in shadow
		'''
	GsPulseBow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: each wall bounce now grants +10% damage (up to 5); volley charge looses 3 parallel pulse tracks, one ammo per volley
		Branded foes bend passing pulses toward them; execution chains a surge to 2 nearby foes
		'''
}

GodSmithBroadswords: {
	# GodSmith mode - Broadswords family (P1) weapon descriptions
	# Keys are composed by the framework: Mods.CalamityOverhaul.GodSmithBroadswords.{SchemeClassName}.Desc
	
	# ===== Progression swords (package lead) =====
	GsLightsBane.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every slash tears a shadow scar into the air;
		the third strike sinks the blade into shadow, then erupts forward, and its scar lingers to corrode
		'''
	# ===== Wood tier =====
	GsWoodenSword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: green wood springs back; landing a hit primes the blade,
		so the next slash within a breath raises twice as fast and deals 10% more damage
		'''
	GsBorealWoodSword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: repeated hits coat the same target in boreal sap;
		the third layer bursts into frost mist and sets the target ablaze with frostburn
		'''
	GsPalmWoodSword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: sweeping shore arcs; the third slash hurls a fan of three sand waves
		that quickly crash to the ground, each hitting once
		'''
	GsRichMahoganySword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: a four-beat vine-whip combo; the fourth slash extends a phantom vine
		for far greater reach and poisons whatever it entangles
		'''
	GsEbonwoodSword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every slash leaves a lingering puff of corrupt spores at the midpoint
		of its path, dealing one tick of light damage to anything caught inside
		'''
	GsShadewoodSword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the third strike opens a bleeding wound; hits against bleeding targets
		deal 18% more damage and quicken your next slash
		'''
	GsAshWoodSword.Desc: Reforged: two quick cuts followed by a slow scorching blow that sets enemies on fire for 3 seconds
	GsCactusSword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: compact desert cuts; when the third slash connects, two cactus needles
		burst backward from the wound, each hitting once
		'''
	# ===== Ore tier =====
	GsCopperBroadsword.Desc: Reforged: a nimble two-beat combo; strikes conduct through drenched foes, dealing bonus damage with a static crackle
	GsTinBroadsword.Desc: Reforged: a four-beat combo that rings up the scale; the fourth resonant strike lands harder in a white flash
	GsLeadBroadsword.Desc: Reforged: slow, brutal swings with heavy knockback; the finisher drops as an overhead slam that shakes dust from the ground
	GsSilverBroadsword.Desc: Reforged: blessed silver that bites harder at night; the finisher smears a long trail of moonlit silver
	GsTungstenBroadsword.Desc: Reforged: notch the same target three times and every following cut ignores part of its armor
	GsGoldBroadsword.Desc: Reforged: gilded afterimages and coin-spark hits; the finisher strikes richer while gold sits in your purse
	GsPlatinumBroadsword.Desc: Reforged: three full-weight cleaves; the finisher lunges with a double shockwave and crushing knockback
	# ===== Environment / drop swords =====
	GsBoneSword.Desc: Reforged: the third strike hurls a spinning bone that arcs through the air, splintering on whatever it strikes
	GsMandibleBlade.Desc: Reforged: every swing bites with twin mandible arcs that snap shut like pincers; the third bite clamps down for extra damage
	GsPurpleClubberfish.Desc: Reforged: a wide wet slap with massive knockback that drenches whatever it hits; slapping a burning enemy puts the fire out for bonus damage
	GsZombieArm.Desc: Reforged: flails with the sloppy rhythm of the undead, no two swings alike; rotten splatter may briefly confuse whatever it hits
	GsStylishScissors.Desc: Reforged: snips in rapid two-beat cuts; every sixth cut on the same target lands a finishing snip for double damage
	GsBladedGlove.Desc: Reforged: a five-beat claw flurry at point-blank range; the fifth strike rakes with a triple claw mark for bonus damage
	GsKatana.Desc: Reforged: the blade vanishes into its own swing arc and reappears frozen at the endpoint; the third strike is a sheathed iai draw that erupts in a single white flash
	GsIceBlade.Desc: Reforged: each slash condenses a spinning ice shard that arcs down in flight; the finisher looses a twin fan of shards
	GsFalconBlade.Desc: Reforged: the fastest three-cut combo of its tier; the third strike is a falcon dive that pounces toward your aim, trailing doubled afterimages
	GsTentacleSpike.Desc: Reforged: strikes smear clinging slime onto victims, and sinking it into flesh drinks a sliver of life back
	GsCandyCaneSword.Desc: Reforged: every fifth strike on the same target cracks the candy coating, dealing 50% bonus damage in a burst of red-and-white sugar shards
	GsDyeTradersScimitar.Desc: Reforged: each sweep dyes its arc a new color of the rainbow; the third stroke flares all seven at once and splatters the target with dye
	# ===== Progression swords =====
	GsBloodButcherer.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: heavy chops stack Exsanguination on the victim; the carving finisher detonates
		every stack into a blood burst, and a full three-stack burst feeds you life
		'''
	GsEnchantedSword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every slash hurls a blade of holy light;
		the finisher's wave widens and pierces through three foes
		'''
	GsStarfury.Desc: Reforged: every slash calls a star down from the zenith; the third strike locks three fated points and brings three stars crashing down together
	GsBeeKeeper.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every strike releases hive bees from the waxen edge; the fourth swing gathers
		three bee shades around the blade and looses them all at once, and wounds drip sticky wax
		'''
	# ===== Mandated A-tier trio =====
	GsMuramasa.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: a five-count iaijutsu string; three flash cuts,
		one long sheathed charge, then a full-arc draw that erupts out of stillness
		'''
	GsBladeofGrass.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: a living jungle blade; every slash scatters biting spore mist along its arc,
		leaf-veins wake as you raise it, and the third strike lashes out with vines that bind the target
		'''
	GsFieryGreatsword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: a hellstone slab that never hides its heave; molten metal drips off the edge
		all swing long, and the third strike is an overhead slam that leaves a burning crater
		'''
	GsAdamantiteSword.Desc: Reforged: slow, crushing adamantite cleaves; the finisher drops as an overhead slam that breaks armor and quakes the ground
	GsBeamSword.Desc: Reforged: every slash casts a beam wave; beam hits charge the blade, and at three charges the next beam erupts into a vast annihilating lance, wider, brighter, piercing deeper
	GsBladetongue.Desc: Reforged: a living crimson blade; striking foes spits twin arcing streams of ichor that lower defense, and the finishing beat's kiss leaves a lingering ichor geyser erupting on the spot
	GsBluePhaseblade.Desc: Reforged: a plasma edge that charges as it cuts; every hit extends the blade, and at full charge the next finishing slash hurls a plasma arc
	GsBluePhasesaber.Desc: Reforged: a perfected plasma saber; hits overcharge the blade for greater reach, every finishing slash casts a short energy arc, and a full charge unleashes an overloaded arc that bursts on impact
	GsBreakerBlade.Desc: Reforged: a two-beat wrecking rhythm; deals 2.5x damage to foes above 90% life, and landing that opening blow shatters their guard in an armor-breaking shockwave
	GsChlorophyteClaymore.Desc: Reforged: a two-beat greatblade; every swing hurls a verdant core that pulses thorns in flight, and the overhead finisher's core roots the ground where it strikes, slowing and stabbing whatever lingers
	GsChlorophyteSaber.Desc: Reforged: a swift three-beat saber; every slash seeds a lingering spore shroud along the arc's edge, and blade strikes on shrouded targets deal bonus damage and stack venom
	GsChristmasTreeSword.Desc: Reforged: each slash hurls a festive ornament in turn: a bursting bauble, a piercing gold star, then a gift box that cracks into shards and raises a little tree of blinking lights that sprinkles stinging stardust
	GsCobaltSword.Desc: Reforged: keep the combo unbroken and the cobalt edge swings ever faster; the fourth strike trails a blue echo arc that cuts again
	GsCutlass.Desc: Reforged: a four-beat plunder dance with rising tempo; land hits to build Panache, and with enough swagger the fourth beat becomes a whirling double-arc slash that strikes twice all around
	GsDD2SquireBetsySword.Desc: Reforged: every slash looses a sonic dragon-roar wave; hits feed the Dragon Soul, and at 4 souls the finisher's wave ascends into twin coiling dragons
	GsDD2SquireDemonSword.Desc: Reforged: raise the shield with right click as ever; a perfect block still repays fivefold force on the next strike, and brands the blade with hellfire: the next three slashes hurl burning waves that ignite foes
	GsFetidBaghnakhs.Desc: Reforged: a four-beat point-blank claw flurry; every hit rakes a festering mark into the target, and the fourth mark bursts into pus, poisoning and envenoming everything it splatters
	GsFrostbrand.Desc: Reforged: winter's breath; every slash exhales a frost bolt that stalls and surges in flight, hits inflict Frostburn, and the finishing beat fans the bolt into three ice shards
	GsGreenPhaseblade.Desc: Reforged: a plasma edge that charges as it cuts; every hit extends the blade, and at full charge the next finishing slash hurls a plasma arc
	GsGreenPhasesaber.Desc: Reforged: a perfected plasma saber; hits overcharge the blade for greater reach, every finishing slash casts a short energy arc, and a full charge unleashes an overloaded arc that bursts on impact
	GsHamBat.Desc: Reforged: the power of satiety; swings grow greasier and mightier with your Well Fed tier (+5%/+10%/+15% damage), and the finishing beat splatters meat scraps with a burst of savory aroma
	GsInfluxWaver.Desc: Reforged: Martian phase-steel; every slash casts a phase wave that blinks to the far side of its victim and strikes back twice, blink strikes brand the target with a phase mark, and the third overdrive slash calls an extra phase blade on every branded foe, up to three
	GsKeybrand.Desc: Reforged: strikes deal up to double damage as the target's health falls; below 30% health the blade lights golden key-runes, and executing such prey bursts into unlocking light
	GsMeowmere.Desc: Reforged: a candy-frosted cat blade playing a four-beat meow sonata; every slash flings a bouncing cat head trailing rainbow ribbon, hits collect musical notes, and at seven notes the finisher calls a cat meteor crashing down from the sky
	GsMythrilSword.Desc: Reforged: every slash brands its target with a mythril seal; the third seal rings out as a resonant shockwave
	GsOrangePhaseblade.Desc: Reforged: a plasma edge that charges as it cuts; every hit extends the blade, and at full charge the next finishing slash hurls a plasma arc
	GsOrangePhasesaber.Desc: Reforged: a perfected plasma saber; hits overcharge the blade for greater reach, every finishing slash casts a short energy arc, and a full charge unleashes an overloaded arc that bursts on impact
	GsOrichalcumSword.Desc: Reforged: each swing scatters drifting petals along the arc that flutter, then dive at nearby prey; the finisher looses a full bloom
	GsPalladiumSword.Desc: Reforged: hits store vitality in the warm palladium edge; the finisher draws it out as life motes that fly back and mend you, up to six per combo
	GsPearlwoodSword.Desc: Reforged: a playful pearlwood combo that flings bursting pearls with every slash; the third strike calls a short pearl rain from above
	GsPiercingStarlight.Desc: Reforged: each use is a three-thrust starlight cadence; the final thrust fires a piercing star bolt, and three faultless cadences in a row make the bolt burst into a starburst on hit
	GsPsychoKnife.Desc: Reforged: a two-beat flicker of blackened steel; the first strike from deep stealth is a backstab dealing heavily bonus damage, and kills fade you back to half-stealth instead of fully exposing you
	GsPurplePhaseblade.Desc: Reforged: a plasma edge that charges as it cuts; every hit extends the blade, and at full charge the next finishing slash hurls a plasma arc
	GsPurplePhasesaber.Desc: Reforged: a perfected plasma saber; hits overcharge the blade for greater reach, every finishing slash casts a short energy arc, and a full charge unleashes an overloaded arc that bursts on impact
	GsRedPhaseblade.Desc: Reforged: a plasma edge that charges as it cuts; every hit extends the blade, and at full charge the next finishing slash hurls a plasma arc
	GsRedPhasesaber.Desc: Reforged: a perfected plasma saber; hits overcharge the blade for greater reach, every finishing slash casts a short energy arc, and a full charge unleashes an overloaded arc that bursts on impact
	GsSeedler.Desc: Reforged: every slash hurls a spinning seed pod that bounces and bursts into a fan of seeking thorns; the finisher's pod erupts into vines, raising a lingering bramble patch that keeps stabbing
	GsSlapHand.Desc: Reforged: a three-beat divine slapping; every hit stamps a giant palm print with absurd knockback along the swing, and the finisher claps both palms together, ringing out a small shockwave
	GsStarWrath.Desc: Reforged: every slash calls three comet-tailed stars down from the night sky; landed hits build the Star Tide, and at full tide the finishing slash unleashes a cascade of falling stars crowned by one great star that bursts into a ring
	GsTheHorsemansBlade.Desc: Reforged: striking a foe summons a flaming jack-o'-lantern to run it down; repeated strikes on one victim brand Headhunt marks, and at full marks the finishing slash calls a cavalry of four burning pumpkins to trample the line
	GsTitaniumSword.Desc: Reforged: every slash leaves a titanium shade hanging in the air that replays the same cut half a beat later
	GsWhitePhaseblade.Desc: Reforged: a plasma edge that charges as it cuts; every hit extends the blade, and at full charge the next finishing slash hurls a plasma arc
	GsWhitePhasesaber.Desc: Reforged: a perfected plasma saber; hits overcharge the blade for greater reach, every finishing slash casts a short energy arc, and a full charge unleashes an overloaded arc that bursts on impact
	GsYellowPhaseblade.Desc: Reforged: a plasma edge that charges as it cuts; every hit extends the blade, and at full charge the next finishing slash hurls a plasma arc
	GsYellowPhasesaber.Desc: Reforged: a perfected plasma saber; hits overcharge the blade for greater reach, every finishing slash casts a short energy arc, and a full charge unleashes an overloaded arc that bursts on impact
}

GodSmithExemplars: {
	GsIronBroadsword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: a three-beat butcher combo of raise, poise and cleave;
		the third strike lunges forward with a heavier arc
		'''
}

GodSmithFlails: {
	GsBallOHurt.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: spin to charge the swing; the flying ball sheds hovering barbs along its path
		A fully charged strike bursts a ring of barbs on the target
		'''
	GsChainKnife.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: landing a blade hit grants Momentum for 7 seconds
		Each stack spins up and throws faster, up to 3 stacks
		'''
	GsTheMeatball.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: a fully charged strike bursts into a gout of gore
		The burst wounds everything nearby and inflicts Bleeding
		'''
	GsBlueMoon.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: charged strikes loose piercing crescent blades through the target
		Half charge looses one blade, a full charge looses three
		'''
	GsSunfury.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the flying ball sears hovering scorch marks along its path
		The marks linger and burn whoever touches them with hellfire
		'''
	GsMace.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: a fully charged strike cracks the target's armor, halving its defense for a few seconds
		Heavier knockback backs up every blow
		'''
	GsFlamingMace.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: spinning the mace flings burning embers outward
		Faster spins throw the embers harder and farther, igniting whatever they strike
		'''
	GsDaoofPow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: throws alternate between Yin and Yang; a Yin strike brands and slows the target
		A Yang strike on a branded target detonates the brand into a burst of light and ink
		'''
	GsFlowerPow.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: petals bloom around the head while spinning, up to five
		Landing a throw sends every petal homing at the target as razor blades
		'''
	GsDripplerFlail.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: at high spin and through every throw, the head weeps gravity-bound blood beads
		Beads burst into stinging blood spikes on contact or landing
		'''

	GsKOCannon: {
		Desc:
			'''
			Reforged: a braced straight punch; land three solid hits on the same target within four seconds
			The third punch is a KO: double damage, double knockback, and a concussive ring
			'''
		TipKO: KO!
	}

	GsChainGuillotines.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: hurls both guillotines at once, fanning apart mid-flight
		When the two blades cross paths they shear, bursting cross-cut slashes between them
		'''
	GsGolemFist.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: solid hits stack heat (up to 3, +8% damage each, fades after 8 seconds); at full heat the fist runs molten and impacts hurl 3 magma chunks
		Every punch that lands on a foe or a wall slams out a stone shockwave
		'''
	GsFlairon.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the chain squeezes out homing bubble blades while swinging and flying (up to 8 afield, 40% damage each)
		A full-spin strike bursts a ring of six bubble blades around the target
		'''
}

GodSmithFlamethrowers: {
	GsFlamethrower.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: a wide cone that leaves burning ground
		Sustained spraying drains pressure and shortens the flame; ease off to recover
		'''
	GsElfMelter.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: wide red-green flame laced with thaw mist
		Pressure rules still apply: long sprays shorten the flame
		'''
}

GodSmithGuns: {
	GsMinishark: {
		Desc:
			'''
			トリガーを引き続けるとサメが血の味を覚え、熱狂状態が蓄積する
			熱狂状態が高まるほど連射速度が上昇する代わりに、弾の拡散が激しくなる
			熱狂状態が最大になると、4発ごとにサメの牙のような弾丸へ変化し、傷口をさらに引き裂く
			ジャストリロードを成功させると熱狂状態が半分蓄積する
			'''
		Frenzy: Frenzy!
	}

	GsPhoenixBlaster: {
		Desc:
			'''
			命中するたびに核へ炎の力が蓄積され、銃がより強く輝く
			敵を倒すと蓄積速度が上昇する
			24個の炎が集まると、次の弾が不死鳥に変化し、急降下して爆発した後、3羽の追尾する鳥へ分裂する
			リロードすると余った炎が弾倉へ戻り、ジャストリロードを成功させると炎を8個獲得する
			'''
		Nirvana: Nirvana!
	}

	GsBoomstick.Desc:
		'''
		各銃身から4発の弾丸を発射し、拡散せずカーソルへ向かって収束する
		弾丸が交差する地点で顎が閉じ、その地点にいる敵を噛み裂く
		ジャストリロードを成功させると各銃身の発射弾数が1発増える
		'''

	GsHandgun: {
		Desc:
			'''
			同じ敵に3発命中させると、4発目が急所を狙う弾丸になる
			この弾丸はダメージが80%増加し、敵の防御力を15無視する
			最後の1発は強い反動でスライドを動かし、次弾の装填を補助する
			着脱式マガジンの訓練により、タクティカルリロードはほぼ一瞬で完了できる
			ジャストリロードも成功させやすい
			'''
		PointShot: Pressure point!
	}

	GsTheUndertaker.Desc:
		'''
		敵を倒すか瀕死状態にすると、銃が魂火を集める
		魂火は1回の装填につき1度自身を回復する
		最後の弾は埋葬の鐘を響かせ、ノックバックが2倍の血塗れの弾丸を放つ
		'''

	GsRedRyder: {
		Desc:
			'''
			銅のBB弾がブロックに当たると2回まで跳ね返る
			同じ敵へ短時間に5回命中させると、次の弾が祝福された弾丸となり、祝祭色の破片をまき散らす
			レバー操作でBB弾を1発ずつ装填し、好きなタイミングで発射できる
			'''
		Gift: Gift round!
	}

	GsPewMaticHorn: {
		Desc:
			'''
			7発の音階マガジンを持ち、各弾は対応する音の色に変化する
			同じ敵へ3発連続で命中させると和音が発生し、3発目の色のペイント爆発を起こす
			リロード中に音階が上昇し、最高音のタイミングでジャストリロードに成功するとより強力な和音になる
			'''
		Chord: Chord!
	}

	GsSandgun: {
		Desc:
			'''
			撃ち続けるとホッパーが熱を持ち、砂を送り続けると銃内部で砂が溶け始める
			溶解状態では弾丸がガラス弾となり、飛行速度と貫通力が向上し、砕けて鋭い破片を撒き散らす
			リロードでは3回の砂音と共に補充し、ジャストリロードに成功するとホッパーが即座に発熱状態になる
			'''
		Molten: Molten!
	}

	GsBlowpipe.Desc:
		'''
		同じ敵へ命中するたびスタックが蓄積され、3スタック溜まると持続する毒霧を発生させる
		リロードは息を整える動作となり、一息ごとにダーツを1本補充する
		静止中は呼吸速度が25%上昇する
		ジャストリロードで次の矢に毒を仕込み、命中時に蓄積した毒スタックを即座に発動させる
		'''

	GsBlowgun.Desc:
		'''
		長い一呼吸で5本のダーツを放ち、それぞれ前のダーツより強く速く飛ぶ
		5本目のダーツは肺の力をすべて使い切り、命中時に広範囲の毒霧を発生させる強力な矢になる
		一息ごとにダーツを1本補充し、静止中はより速く補充できる
		ジャストリロードで最初から3本目のダーツと同じ威力になる
		'''

	GsHarpoon.Desc:
		'''
		銛を発射すると飛んでいき、鎖を伝って戻ってくる
		銛が戻ってくることでリロードされる
		重量級の敵を貫くとアンカーを設置し、再度トリガーを引くことでプレイヤーを引き寄せる
		軽量級の敵はプレイヤーの元へ引き寄せることができる
		'''

	GsFlareGun.Desc:
		'''
		赤、緑、青、白の4色フレア使用し、各フレアは敵に突き刺さって燃え続ける
		刺さった敵は受けるダメージが12%増加する（白フレアのみ16%）
		ジャストリロードで次の射撃時に2発のフレアを発射する
		'''

	GsFlintlockPistol.Desc:
		'''
		2つの弾室を持ち、2発目は40%速く発射される
		最後の弾は1発の弾丸からV字型に分裂するノックバックが2倍の弾を2発撃つ
		ジャストリロードで次の射撃の威力が25%増加する
		'''

	GsMusket.Desc:
		'''
		すべての弾丸が貫通弾となる
		弾速が上昇し、追加で1体の敵を貫通する
		'''

	GsQuadBarrelShotgun.Desc:
		'''
		4発を順番に高速発射する
		4発目は8発の散弾を同時に放ち、反動で自身を後方へ吹き飛ばす
		ジャストリロードで散弾が2発増加される
		'''

	GsRevolver.Desc: 6発装填の回転式弾倉を持ち、最後の1発は常にダメージが40%増加する

	GsCandyCornRifle: {
		Desc: 弾丸が緩やかな弧を描いて落下する
		ModeCandyRain: キャンディレイン
	}

	GsClockworkAssaultRifle: {
		Desc: 3発目はダメージが30%増加する
		ModeGearBurst: ギアバースト
	}

	GsGatligator: {
		Desc: 全ての弾丸がブロックに当たると1回跳弾するようになる
		ModeSwampRiot: 沼地の乱射
	}

	GsMegashark: {
		Desc:
			'''
			トリガーを引き続けるほど連射速度が上昇する
			50回命中すると流血を引き起こし、3秒間出血を付与する
			'''
		ModeFrenzy: 捕食の熱狂
	}

	GsOnyxBlaster: {
		Desc:
			'''
			右クリックでチャージする
			一斉射撃は爆発地点に残留する残留する暗黒の跡を残し、敵を引き寄せる
			チャージは発射速度が低下するが、巨大なオニキスの弾を1発放つ
			爆発は中心へ全てを引き寄せ、弾丸を円状に拡散する
			'''
		ModeVolley: 一斉射撃
		ModeSingularity: チャージ
	}

	GsSDMG: {
		Desc: 伝説的な連射速度を維持する
		ModeDolphinTide: イルカの潮流
	}

	GsShotgun: {
		Desc:
			'''
			6発の散弾を広範囲へ放ち、1回の射撃で3回以上命中すると対象へ鉛弾の雨を降らせる
			弾は1発のみ消費する
			'''
		ModeWideBore: 広口径
	}

	GsSniperRifle: {
		Desc:
			'''
			右クリックで射撃モードを切り替え、長押しでスコープを覗く
			狙撃モードでは貫通する照準線を表示する
			静止すると狙いが安定し、精密な射撃は必ずクリティカルになる
			高速射撃モードは威力が低下する代わりに連射速度が上昇する
			'''
		ModeSnipe: 狙撃
		ModeRapid: 高速射撃
	}

	GsTacticalShotgun: {
		Desc: 射撃範囲が表示され、6発の弾丸が届く範囲を正確に確認できる
		ModeFan: 扇状射撃
	}

	GsUzi: {
		Desc:
			'''
			連射速度が30%上昇し、弾の拡散範囲を可視化する
			4発ごとに琥珀色の曳光弾を発射する
			曳光弾が命中した敵を照らし、ダメージが10%増加する
			'''
		ModeAkimbo: 二丁持ち
	}

	GsVenusMagnum: {
		Desc: 
			'''
			クリティカル後、次の弾丸は追加で敵を1体貫通する
			その効果中は照準線が表示される
			'''
		ModeFocus: マグナムフォーカス
	}

	GsVortexBeater: {
		Desc: ロケットがゆっくり追尾する
		ModeSweep: ボルテックス掃討
	}

	GsXenopopper: {
		Desc: 5つの泡を放ち、カーソル地点へ収束して十字砲火のように炸裂する
		ModeCluster: 集束爆発
	}

	GsShotgunLeadRainProj.DisplayName: Gs Shotgun Lead Rain Proj
	GsUziTracerProj.DisplayName: Gs Uzi Tracer Proj
}

GodSmithLaunchers: {
	GsElectrosphereLauncher: {
		Desc: 
			'''
			2つ以上の球体がテスラアークで接続される（最大3つ、球体ダメージの半分）
			右クリックで全てを過負荷状態にする
			範囲が40%増加し、2秒後に放電する
			'''
		TipOverload: Overload!
	}

	GsGrenadeLauncher: {
		Desc: 
			'''
			グレネードが壁や敵に付着する
			肉体に付着時、ダメージが25%増加する
			自己起爆しなくなり、右クリックで設置した全てを起爆する（最大6個）
			'''
		TipDetonate: Blast them all!
	}

	GsJackOLanternLauncher: {
		Desc: 
			'''
			右クリックで全てのカボチャが一斉に炸裂する
			それぞれが3つの追尾する炎を放つ
			炸裂地点には立っている者を焼き焦がすロウソクの炎を残す
			'''
		TipGrin: Grin in unison!
	}

	GsNailGun: {
		Desc: 
			'''
			釘が肉体に食い込む（1体につき最大5本）
			刺さった釘1本につき、あらゆる攻撃から受けるダメージが3%増加する
			右クリックで全ての釘を引き抜き、破片を撒き散らす
			'''
		TipExtract: Rip them out!
	}

	GsProximityMineLauncher: {
		Desc: 
			'''
			地雷の起爆範囲が表示される
			右クリックで設置順に連鎖させる
			60秒間待機した地雷はロケット1発分を返還して消滅する
			'''
		TipChain: Domino!
		TipRecycle: Mine reclaimed
	}

	GsRocketLauncher: {
		Desc: 
			'''
			右クリックで飛行中の全ロケットを起爆する
			空中炸裂したロケットはカーソル方向へ貫通するダーツを3発放つ
			'''
		TipDetonate: Airburst!
	}

	GsSnowmanCannon: {
		Desc: 
			'''
			右クリックでロケットの挙動を切り替える
			誘導：敵を追尾するロケットを発射し、命中した敵に雪の結晶を付与する
			降下弾幕：ロケットを上空へ打ち上げ、カーソル地点上空から急降下させる
			'''
		ModeHoming: モード：追尾
		ModeOrbital: モード：降下弾幕
	}

	GsStarCannon.Desc: 
			'''
			右クリックで発射方式を切り替える
			直射モードでは星をまっすぐ発射する
			星降りモードでは星を上空へ打ち上げ、カーソル周辺へ降らせる
			命中時に星屑を撒き散らす
			'''

	GsStynger: {
		Desc: 
			'''
			右クリックで信管を切り替える
			着弾：命中時に爆発する
			炸裂：カーソルまでの距離で空中炸裂し、破片を狭い扇状範囲へ放つ
			跳弾：ブロックで1回跳ね返った後に爆発する
			'''
		ModeImpact: モード：着弾
		ModeRange: モード：炸裂
		ModeRicochet: モード：跳弾
	}
}

GodSmithMagicCataclysm: {
	GsBatScepter.Desc:
		'''
		命中するたびにナイトフォールが蓄積し、最大まで溜めると右クリックで蝙蝠の大群を呼び起こす
		幻影の月が昇り、無数の蝙蝠が敵へ殺到した後、自身の周囲を守るように旋回する
		8匹目の蝙蝠が噛みつくたび、幻影の蝙蝠が分離して近くの別の敵へ飛びかかる
		'''
	GsRazorpine.Desc:
		'''
		再鍛造：命中するたびに樹脂が蓄積し、最大まで溜めると右クリックで針の嵐を巻き起こす
		針の輪が自身の周囲を狭めながら収束し、最後は足元に針の群れとして残る
		針が命中するたびに樹脂が付着し、1体の敵に5回付着すると4本の針がその敵を取り囲むように迫る
		'''
	GsBlizzardStaff.Desc:
		'''
		命中するたびに吹雪が蓄積し、最大まで溜めると右クリックでカーソル地点に猛吹雪を呼び起こす
		巨大な吹雪が周囲を猛烈に襲い、地面に霜柱を残す
		5本目の氷柱が霜となり、消滅した地点で小規模な冷気を起こす
		'''
	GsStaffofEarth.Desc:
		'''
		命中するたびに大地の怒りが蓄積し、最大まで溜めると右クリックでカーソル地点に岩石の山を引き起こす
		飛び交う岩石の中から岩柱が波状に噴き出し、その跡にマグマが広がる
		岩塊は敵を押し潰すたびに勢いを増し、砕けた地点から通常の半分の高さの岩柱が噴き出す
		'''
	GsBetsysWrath.Desc:
		'''
		命中するたびに竜の炎が蓄積し、最大まで溜めると右クリックで竜の怒りを呼び起こす
		ベッツィの影が炎のカーテンを引きながら3回急降下し、呪われた炎床を残す
		呪われた敵への命中で追加の竜の炎が蓄積し、4回目の呪いへの命中で呪炎が炸裂する
		'''
	GsNightglow.Desc:
		'''
		命中するたびに夜明けの光が蓄積し、最大まで溜めると右クリックでカーソル地点に極光の帳を広げる
		帳が範囲内の敵を焼き、下方へ光の槍を降らせる
		5回目の光が命中時、対象の頭上からオーロラの槍が降り注ぐ
		'''
	GsStellarTune.Desc:
		'''
		命中するたびにメロディが蓄積し、最大まで溜めると右クリックで星のフィナーレを開く
		敵に向かって星の和音がリズムに合わせて自動で奏でられ、その間、自身の動きが少し速くなる
		連続して命中するたびに音階が上がり、8音目で星の和音が炸裂する
		'''
	GsResonanceScepter.Desc:
		'''
		命中するたびにレゾナンスが蓄積し、最大まで溜めると右クリックでカーソル地点の共鳴を崩壊させる
		5つの波動がその場に留まる敵を攻撃する
		3体目の敵を貫くたびに衝撃波を放つ
		'''
	GsNebulaArcanum.Desc:
		'''
		命中するたびに秘術が蓄積し、最大まで溜めると右クリックで星雲の螺旋を展開する
		3本の星雲の帯が自身の周囲を旋回し、敵を削りながら小型の敵を内側へ引き寄せる
		秘術のオーブは飛翔中に膨張し、小型の敵をその中心へゆっくり引き寄せる
		ゲージが溜まるにつれて杖から星雲の霧が立ち昇る
		'''
	GsNebulaBlaze.Desc:
		'''
		命中するたびに猛火が蓄積し、最大まで溜めると右クリックでカーソル付近の敵にノヴァの印を付ける
		重力の渦を中心に3つの爆発リングが時間差で広がる
		星雲が命中すると、必ず着弾地点で小さいノヴァを発生させる
		'''
	GsLunarFlare.Desc:
		'''
		命中するたびにムーンフェイズが蓄積し、最大まで溜めると右クリックで月蝕を引き起こす
		月蝕の円盤から12本のフレアが編み込まれるように降り注ぎ、3本ごとに幻影の月光が加わる
		4回目の発動ごとに、空から淡い4本目のフレアが降り注ぐ
		ゲージが溜まるにつれて本に月光が集まる
		'''
	GsBatSwarmDirector.DisplayName: 蝙蝠の大群
	GsPineStormDirector.DisplayName: 針の嵐
	GsWhiteoutDirector.DisplayName: 猛吹雪
	GsOrogenyDirector.DisplayName: 岩石の山
	GsEarthPillarProj.DisplayName: 山柱
	GsDragonWrathDirector.DisplayName: 竜の怒り
	GsAuroraCurtainDirector.DisplayName: 極光の帳
	GsAuroraLanceProj.DisplayName: オーロラの槍
	GsStellarFinaleDirector.DisplayName: 星のフィナーレ
	GsResonanceCollapseDirector.DisplayName: 調和崩壊
	GsNebulaSpiralDirector.DisplayName: 星雲の螺旋
	GsNovaDetonationDirector.DisplayName: ノヴァ
	GsSpectreStaff.Desc:
		'''
		命中するたびにソウルハーベストが蓄積し、最大まで溜めると右クリックでカーソル地点に魂の奔流を呼び起こす
		ゲージが4分の1溜まるたびに残響する魂が1つ分離し、近くの別の敵を追跡する
		3つの奔流が輪を描いて押し寄せ、それぞれが敵に命中するたび1秒に最大6回までライフを1回復する
		'''
	GsLunarEclipseDirector.DisplayName: 月蝕
	GsMoonPillarProj.DisplayName: 幻影の月光
	GsSpectreStaffTideDirector.DisplayName: 魂の奔流
	GsInfernoFork.Desc:
		'''
		火球が炉の残滓を巻き上げながら螺旋状に飛び、命中するたびに燼火が蓄積する
		ゲージが最大まで溜まると右クリックでカーソル地点にワイルドファイアを発生させ、3波の炎が地面を走り、その間に炎の雨が降り注ぎ、最後に燃え残った火種が燻り続ける
		'''
	GsInfernoForkWildfireDirector.DisplayName: ワイルドファイア
	GsCataclysmRiderBurstProj.DisplayName: カタクリズムの余震
}

GodSmithMagicChant: {
	GsWandOfSparking.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、タイミングの合った火花が近くの敵へ連鎖して着火する
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱が12個の火花を扇状に放つ
		'''
	GsWandOfFrosting.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、氷魔法が命中時に氷片へと分裂する
		共鳴が深いほど分裂数が増え、共鳴が最大になると次の詠唱が広範囲に凍結の霧を吐き出し、凍傷を与える
		'''
	GsThunderZapper.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、雷撃が本物の雷のようにジグザグに飛び、折れ曲がるたびに枝分かれすることがある
		共鳴が高いほど発射間隔が短くなり、共鳴が最大になると次の命中時に対象へ雷印を刻み、雷柱を落とす
		'''
	GsAmethystStaff.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、弾が命中時に砕け、敵を貫通するアメジストの破片になる
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱が色合いの異なる3つの宝石弾を放つ
		'''
	GsTopazStaff.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、弾が命中時に砕け、敵を追尾するトパーズの破片になる
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱が色合いの異なる3つの宝石弾を放つ
		'''
	GsSapphireStaff.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、弾が命中時に砕け、素早く飛ぶサファイアの槍になる
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱が色合いの異なる3つの宝石弾を放つ
		'''
	GsEmeraldStaff.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、弾が命中時に砕け、素早く飛ぶサファイアの槍になる
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱が色合いの異なる3つの宝石弾を放つ
		'''
	GsRubyStaff.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、弾が命中時に砕け、小さな爆発を起こすルビーの破片になる
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱が色合いの異なる3つの宝石弾を放つ
		'''
	GsDiamondStaff.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、弾が命中時に砕け、2本の光線を屈折させるダイヤモンドの破片になる
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱が色合いの異なる3つの宝石弾を放つ
		'''
	GsAmberStaff.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、弾が命中時に砕け、2本の光線を屈折させるダイヤモンドの破片になる
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱が色合いの異なる3つの宝石弾を放つ
		'''
	GsVilethorn.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、棘が命中地点で枝分かれして邪悪な棘を生やす
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱で自分の周囲にも棘の輪が発生する
		'''
	GsWaterBolt.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、水弾がさらに遠くまで跳ね返り、跳ね返るたびに波紋を広げる
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱があらゆるものを貫通する巨大な奔流へと変わる
		'''
	GsBookOfSkulls.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、命中した敵に印を刻み、髑髏が印を刻まれた敵を追尾する
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱で3つの髑髏を放ち、3つの印が爆発して骨片を撒き散らす
		'''
	GsDemonScythe.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、大鎌の加速が速くなり、共鳴が高いと手元へ戻ってくることがある
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱でカーソル地点を中心に2つの大鎌が交差する
		'''
	GsAquaScepter.Desc:
		'''
		噴射を続けるほど水圧が高まり、強烈な水圧による奔流が発生する
		3回連続で水圧を最大まで高めると、次の詠唱が潮流の衝撃波を扇状に放つ
		'''
	GsFlowerOfFire.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、火球が最初の着弾時に炎を扇状に放つ
		共鳴が最大になると、次の火球が着弾地点に燃え盛る炎の領域を作り出す
		'''
	GsBeeGun.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、蜂の群れがV字編隊で飛び、共鳴が高いほど大きな蜂が生まれる
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱で女王蜂を放ち、その後を生きた蜂の群れが追従する
		'''
	GsSpaceGun.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて撃つと共鳴が蓄積し、コイルへ電荷が蓄積する（外しても電荷は減少しない）
		4回目の蓄積時に広範囲を貫通するパルスを放ち、弱い敵を引き寄せる
		'''
	GsGrayZapinator.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて撃つと共鳴が蓄積し、高電圧の電撃を放つ
		共鳴が最大になると、次の電撃が肥大化した貫通ビームへと暴走する
		'''
	GsLaserRifle.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて撃つと共鳴が蓄積し、3発目の射撃が2本の平行レーザーに分裂する
		共鳴が最大になると、次の射撃が広範囲を薙ぎ払うオーバードライブを起こし、その後しばらく銃身が弱体化する
		'''
	GsWeatherPain.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、命中した敵の位置に嵐の目を残し、そこへ向かって加速しながら拡大する
		共鳴が高いと竜巻が2つに分かれ、共鳴が最大になると次の詠唱で巨大な嵐を呼び起こす
		'''
	GsCursedFlames.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、弾が呪いの種を植え付け、3つ目の種が発火すると呪われた棘の輪とその場に残る炎を生み出す
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱で呪いの蛇を放つ
		'''
	GsChantFlameFieldProj.DisplayName: 燃え盛る花園
	GsChantStormChoirProj.DisplayName: 嵐の合唱
	GsCursedFlamesSerpentProj.DisplayName: 呪いの蛇
	GsCursedFlamesPoolProj.DisplayName: 呪われた炎
	GsGoldenShower.Desc:
		'''
		命中するたびに溶融した霊液の印を刻み、5つ目の層が8方向へ飛び散る液滴と霊液の塊を生み出す
		間断なく噴射して高圧状態を作ると、弾速が上がり、流れが密になり、印が2倍の速さで刻まれる
		'''
	GsCrystalVileShard.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、槍が命中時にクリスタルの種を埋め込む
		槍が砕けると、種を埋め込まれた敵から破片の光線が十字に放たれる
		共鳴が最大になると次の詠唱で自分の周囲に6本のクリスタルの槍が出現する
		'''
	GsUnholyTrident.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、攻撃が3本の穂先を持つ三叉槍に分裂して地獄の炎をまとい、敵を焼き払う
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱でカーソル地点の下から4列の地獄の三叉槍が突き上がる
		'''
	GsNettleBurst.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、蔓が命中地点に根を張り、刺々しいイラクサの茂みを残す（最大3つ）
		共鳴が最大になると、次の詠唱で巨大な蔓の竜を放ち、戦場を薙ぎ払う
		'''
	GsWaspGun.Desc:
		'''
		リズムに合わせて詠唱すると共鳴が蓄積し、スズメバチが獲物にフェロモンの印を刻む
		空中にいるすべてのスズメバチが印を刻まれた敵を優先して狙い、共鳴が最大になると次の詠唱で女王スズメバチを放ち、前方を飛びながら蜂を生み出していく
		'''
	GsGoldenShowerDripProj.DisplayName: 霊液の塊
	GsNettleBurstThicketProj.DisplayName: イラクサの茂み
	GsNettleBurstDragonProj.DisplayName: 蔓の竜
	GsWaspGunQueenProj.DisplayName: 女王スズメバチ
}

GodSmithMeleeOddities: {
	# GodSmith MeleeOddities (P5) weapon descriptions
	# Keys composed by the framework: Mods.CalamityOverhaul.GodSmithMeleeOddities.{SchemeClass}.Desc
	
	GsVampireKnives.Desc:
		'''
		4～8本のナイフを投げ、与えたダメージの7.5%を回復する
		奪った血は最大3つのブラッドオーブへ凝縮され、それぞれ次の投擲にナイフを1本追加する
		ブラッドオーブが3つになると、次の投擲が生命力吸収2倍の紅の弾幕になる
		'''
	GsScourgeoftheCorruptor.Desc:
		'''
		ジャベリンが命中時に小さな捕食者の群れへ分裂する
		さらに命中した敵に腐敗した傷を与え、捕食者が突撃する
		3回通過すると傷が破裂し、呪炎を放つ
		'''
	GsSolarEruption.Desc:
		'''
		再鍛造：壁を貫通し、命中時に太陽光を爆発させる連鎖刃を放つ
		8回命中させると光が蓄積し、次の攻撃が軌道全体を燃え上がらせる
		'''
	GsDayBreak.Desc:
		'''
		槍が敵に突き刺さると燃焼する
		1体につき最大8本まで突き刺さる
		1体の敵に4本の槍を刺すと、槍が十字状の爆発を起こす
		'''
	GsSickle.Desc:
		'''
		攻撃で収穫スタックが蓄積し、1スタックごとに攻撃速度が少し上昇する
		5スタックになると、次の攻撃が範囲の刈り払いになる
		'''
	GsIceSickle.Desc:
		'''
		投げた鎌が氷の結晶に変化する
		攻撃で結晶を砕くと、前方へ氷柱を扇状に放つ
		'''
	GsDeathSickle.Desc:
		'''
		壁を貫通する死神の鎌が、敵を刈り取るたびにスタックが蓄積する
		3スタックになると、魂火の輪を放つ
		'''
	GsTerragrim.Desc:
		'''
		溜め続けると成長し、刃の嵐へと変化する
		離すと成長量に応じた刃の波を放つ
		'''
	GsArkhalis.Desc:
		'''
		連続攻撃が20の防御貫通を持つ
		同じ敵へ攻撃を当て続けると洞察スタックが蓄積し、1スタックごとに防御貫通が2増加する
		8スタックになると、連続攻撃が貫通する処刑突きへ変化する
		'''
	GsMonkStaffT1.Desc:
		'''
		グラウンドスマッシュは範囲内に3倍のダメージを与える
		回転中の方向転換や中断ができる
		叩きつけられた敵は眠気を帯びて速度が低下し、同じ敵への3回目の叩きつけで眠りにつく
		その攻撃は威力が上昇し、減速時間も延長される
		'''
	GsMonkStaffT2.Desc:
		'''
		命中するたびに近くの敵を貫くガストを呼び出す
		ガストはその敵の周囲を旋回し、もう一度噛みつく
		'''
	GsMonkStaffT3.Desc:
		'''
		左クリックの振りで龍の息吹が蓄積し、杖の真珠が輝く
		5スタックになると右クリックの龍の球体が上昇し、軌道に沿って雷を落とす
		'''
}

GodSmithShortswords: {
	GsCopperShortsword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every hit strikes a spark off the copper edge;
		the fourth spark bursts into flame at the point, igniting nearby foes
		'''
	GsTinShortsword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: chain your thrusts to climb the tin scale, each note higher than the last;
		at full chime every thrust rings out a rippling pulse and bites a little deeper
		'''
	GsIronShortsword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the recovery stance holds a guard that blunts incoming blows by 30%;
		block a hit to ready a riposte, and your next thrust within a second strikes true
		'''
	GsLeadShortsword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the corroded lead edge poisons whatever it touches;
		striking an already poisoned foe bites 25% deeper into the rot
		'''
	GsSilverShortsword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: mirror-polished silver that drinks moonlight, striking 25% harder and 10% faster at night;
		under a blood moon each hit steals back a sliver of life
		'''
	GsTungstenShortsword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: a dense tungsten core rewards a brief hold before the thrust;
		a full charge lunges half again as far, punching through armor and everything in line
		'''
	GsGoldShortsword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: gilded edge that shakes loose coins, one hit in four rattles change from the wound;
		kills always spill a handful
		'''
	GsPlatinumShortsword.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the thrust outruns its own light, leaving a platinum afterimage hanging along the line;
		foes that brush the lingering light take 40% damage
		'''
	GsGladius.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: legion drill in three beats, two quick thrusts then a shield-step heavy;
		keep the rhythm and each thrust comes faster, up to three tempo stacks
		'''
	GsRuler.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: discipline demands exact measurement, land the very tip for a 1.6x graded strike;
		sloppy hits closer to the hand are marked down to 0.85x
		'''
}

GodSmithSpears: {
	GsSpear.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: drill-manual thrusts in three beats, each one deeper and faster than the last;
		the third beat steps into the strike like a veteran
		'''
	GsTrident.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every strike bursts three jets of seawater from the wound;
		while wet or in the rain the tide rises, jets fly faster and farther
		'''
	GsThunderSpear.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the tip charges while held at full extension; land a hit during that moment
		and lightning arcs to the nearest other enemy, or two in the rain
		'''
	GsTheRottedFork.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: two-beat strikes, a quick jab then a heavy squeeze;
		the heavy beat squeezes a glob of gore from the wound that splats into a corroding pool
		'''
	GsDarkLance.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: hold to feed the lance with devouring shadowflame, release to strike farther and harder;
		a fully charged hit bursts three shadow embers from the wound
		'''
	GsSwordfish.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every thrust leaps you forward along the strike, twice as far underwater;
		while wet the swordfish is in its element and deals 15% more damage
		'''
	GsObsidianSwordfish.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: strikes set enemies on fire and burst obsidian shards from the wound;
		while you are burning or soaked in lava the core reheats, dealing 15% more damage
		'''
	GsCobaltNaginata.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: alternating polework, a straight thrust then a wide cobalt sweep;
		the sweep carves an arc where the thrust line cannot reach
		'''
	GsPalladiumPike.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: each hit stores a charge of vigor in the warm palladium edge;
		at five charges the spear bursts them, restoring 5 life to its wielder
		'''
	GsMythrilHalberd.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: two-beat halberd work, a quick jab then a deep heavy thrust;
		the heavy beat looses a short-ranged mythril crescent that pierces twice
		'''
	GsOrichalcumHalberd.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: every thrust that lands blooms two homing petals from the wound,
		each spiraling after nearby prey
		'''
	GsAdamantiteGlaive.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the last quarter of the blade is a sweet spot;
		landing the very tip shatters armor and staggers, the shaft is just a poke
		'''
	GsTitaniumTrident.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: each thrust casts two parallel shade-tridents above and below the true blade,
		flying a short lane before dissolving
		'''
	GsGungnir.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: a stately three-beat thrust crowned by a golden finisher;
		right click hurls the oath-lance as a piercing bolt of light that never misses its sworn prey
		'''
	GsChlorophytePartisan.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: while the blade dwells at full reach, spores gather on its tip;
		as the spear withdraws it looses a drifting spore cloud that hunts and poisons
		'''
	GsMushroomSpear.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the heavy second beat plants a glowing spore mine in the wound;
		it bursts moments later, harming foes around and feeding 2 life back to the wielder
		'''
	GsNorthPole.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: quick thrusts fling spiraling frost crystals, and the third strike plants a polar pillar
		at the wound that rains icicles; the dwell wreathes the tip in freezing mist
		'''
	GsJoustingLance.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: hold to couch the lance, speed builds momentum, a full-tilt strike deals up to 2.4x damage;
		the longer you ride at full tilt, the more bonus damage the next strike carries
		'''
	GsShadowJoustingLance.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: charging at speed leaves shadowflame embers along your path;
		foes touching an ember take 25% damage and catch shadowflame
		'''
	GsHallowJoustingLance.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: at full tilt, a prismatic star falls on the nearest foe every 0.7s for 40% damage;
		full-tilt strikes burst with holy prismatic light
		'''
}

GodSmithSpecials: {
	GsChainGun.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: hold to spin up, ramping to the fastest fire rate in the land until the barrels glow red-hot after 8s of sustained fire, forcing a slowdown until you let go
		Firing slows your movement while you suppress
		'''
	GsDartPistol.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: quick two-round bursts, second dart at 70%
		Dart ammo effects are fully preserved
		'''
	GsDartRifle.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: hold to charge, the aim line fades in, release to loose; a full 1s draw gives x2 dart speed, +2 pierce and +50% damage
		Dart ammo effects are fully preserved
		'''
	GsPiranhaGun.Desc: Reforged: the classic bite-and-hold
	GsToxikarp.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the classic rapid-fire bubbles
		No ammo, as always
		'''
	GsCoinGun.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: Copper fires 3-coin sprays, Silver pierces one extra target, Gold hits 10% harder, Platinum bursts into golden light on hit
		Return on Investment: kills refund 1 coin of that denomination, capped at 3 per second
		'''
}

GodSmithSummonMinionsA: {
	GsSlimeStaff.Desc: Gel Legion: slimes roll in escort formation; two different slimes striking one foe within a beat triggers a gel burst, and the rally order piles them into a sticky mound
	GsFinchStaff.Desc: Finch Phalanx: finches fly a V formation; after the first strike, follow-up pecks on that foe gain stacking power, and the rally order forms a wheeling flock
	GsAbigailsFlower.Desc: Companion Soul: Abigail's strikes leave a soothing soul-light ring that empowers your minions inside it; under the assault order she focuses her wrath on the marked foe
	GsFlinxStaff.Desc: Snowball Avalanche: flinxes bound in a relay column; the fourth tackle on one foe within the window lands half again harder and frostburns, and the rally order piles a snow drift
	GsHornetStaff.Desc: Hive Firenet: hornets hover in a honeycomb lattice; three stingers into one foe burst a venom pod that lingers as poison mist, and the assault order quickens every stinger
	GsVampireFrogStaff.Desc: Blood Frog Feast: frogs flank you in twin files; their bites may spill a marrow bead that flies back to heal you, and the blood moon whips them into a crimson frenzy
	GsImpStaff.Desc: Hellfire Battery: imps hold a rear artillery line; under the assault order, three fireballs into one foe raise a pyre column beneath it
	GsSpiderStaff.Desc: Web Hunt: three spider breeds hold a triangle watch; concerted bites truss the prey in a binding web that deepens every wound, and every bite now envenoms
	GsBladeStaff.Desc: Bagua Blade Wheel: daggers orbit as a slow-turning wheel; a dagger's sixth consecutive strike on one foe cuts armor-deep and flashes a phantom cross-slash for 40% more, and the rally order raises a gate of blades

	GsLegionBannerProj: {
		DisplayName: Legion Banner
		GuardTip: Guard
		AssaultTip: Assault!
		RallyTip: Rally!
		CommandHint: Right click: assault a foe, rally at a spot, or point near yourself to recall
	}

	GsRallyFieldProj.DisplayName: Rally Ground
	GsGelBurstProj.DisplayName: Gel Burst
	GsVenomPodProj.DisplayName: Venom Pod
	GsImpPyreProj.DisplayName: Pyre Column
	GsBloodSipProj.DisplayName: Marrow Bead
	GsWebBindProj.DisplayName: Binding Web
	GsSoulSolaceProj.DisplayName: Soul Solace Ring
	GsBladeStaffPhantomProj.DisplayName: Gs Blade Staff Phantom Proj
}

GodSmithSummonMinionsB: {
	GsOpticStaff.Desc: Twin Pact: the mini twins fly wing formation; under the assault order, a laser and a ram biting one foe in quick succession cross their sights into an X-flash that ignites cursed flames
	GsSanguineStaff.Desc: Sanguine Homing: under the assault order, each bat bite tears a crescent of clotted blood off the marked prey that wings back to you, cutting whatever stands in its path
	GsPirateStaff.Desc: Plunder Writ: every pirate strike stashes loot; under the rally order, six shares crack the chest open at the flag and five gilded mortar coins rain toward nearby foes, marking them with the Midas touch
	GsPygmyStaff.Desc: Headhunt Drums: under the rally order, a spear strike raises a totem at the flag; inside its war-drum ring your minions hit 10% harder and pygmy spears steep their venom deeper
	GsRavenStaff.Desc: Omen Collapse: under the assault order, four pecks from two different ravens fold the marked prey's shadow into a dire omen that detonates in shadowflame
	GsDeadlySphereStaff.Desc: Grinder Protocol: under the assault order, three sphere slams within a breath rivet a whirling saw ring into the marked foe, grinding it with sparking steel teeth
	GsTempestStaff.Desc: Confluence Surge: under the assault order, a tempest lash and a mini shark bite landing on one foe in quick succession merge into a sweeping tidal wall that batters everything in its path
	GsXenoStaff.Desc: Orbital Calibration: under the assault order, four lasers into the marked foe finish the calibration and call down an annihilation lance from high orbit
	GsStardustCellStaff.Desc: Mitosis Tide: under the assault order, once three little cells cling to the marked foe, the next cell slam splits into five seeking spores that each deepen the cellular corrosion
	GsStardustDragonStaff.Desc: Skyrift Piercer: under the assault order, two drills of the dragon's head into the marked foe tear open a star rift at the wound that gushes falling stardust
	GsEmpressBlade.Desc: Prismatic Finale: under the assault order, six slashes from at least two blades open the execution rite; six phantom blades fan out above the marked prey and plunge through it one by one in rainbow order
	GsStormTigerStaff.Desc: Ambush Rend: under the assault order, three tiger strikes within a breath unleash the kill rite; three storm-sand claw tears rip through the marked prey, and a mightier tiger stalks a shorter cooldown
	GsOpticCrossrayProj.DisplayName: Crossed Sights
	GsSanguineArcProj.DisplayName: Homing Blood Arc
	GsPiratePlunderProj.DisplayName: Plunder Coin
	GsPygmyTotemProj.DisplayName: Headhunt Totem
	GsRavenOmenProj.DisplayName: Dire Omen
	GsDeadlySphereSawProj.DisplayName: Riveted Grinder
	GsTempestSurgeProj.DisplayName: Confluence Wall
	GsXenoOrbitalProj.DisplayName: Orbital Annihilation Lance
	GsStardustCellMoteProj.DisplayName: Mitosis Spore
	GsStardustDragonRiftProj.DisplayName: Star Rift
	GsEmpressFinaleProj.DisplayName: Prismatic Finale
	GsStormTigerRendProj.DisplayName: Ambush Claw Rend
}

GodSmithSummonSentries: {
	GsHoundiusShootius.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: hits charge the eye, right-click when full to overdrive it into twin-pupil rapid fire
		Its victims are briefly exposed, linked sentries deal 10% more to exposed foes
		Linked kills on exposed foes feed the eye free charge; redeployed sentries keep a quarter charge
		'''
	GsQueenSpiderStaff.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: hits charge the hive, right-click when full to overdrive into a full swarm
		Eggs leave webbed ground where they land; linking a lightning aura magnetizes the spiders
		'''
	GsFrostHydraStaff.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: every 3 charge grows a phantom head (up to 2) that echoes each shot
		Right-click when full to overdrive into a freezing breath; sentries linked to it inflict frostburn
		'''
	GsFlameburstT1.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: hits charge the tower, right-click when full for saturation barrage
		Overdriven shots fly in triples and scorch a fire ring on hit; linking a ballista widens the blast
		'''
	GsFlameburstT2.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: hits charge the tower, right-click when full for saturation barrage
		Overdriven shots fly in triples and scorch a wider fire ring; linking a ballista widens the blast
		'''
	GsFlameburstT3.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: hits charge the tower, right-click when full for saturation barrage
		Overdrive adds mortar rain on top of triple shots and fire rings; linking a ballista widens the blast
		'''
	GsBallistaT1.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: hits charge the tower, right-click when full for siege repeater fire
		Two linked ballistas nail a cross-fire spike into any target both hit within moments
		'''
	GsBallistaT2.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: hits charge the tower, right-click when full for siege repeater fire
		Two linked ballistas nail a cross-fire spike into any target both hit within moments
		'''
	GsBallistaT3.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: hits charge the tower, right-click when full for siege repeater fire
		Overdriven bolts grow into massive siege shafts; paired ballistas nail cross-fire spikes
		'''
	GsExplosiveTrapT1.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: traps placed near each other form a minefield web, any blast chain-detonates neighbors
		Five blasts auto-overdrive the trap into high explosive; right-click to trigger a chain check
		'''
	GsExplosiveTrapT2.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: traps placed near each other form a minefield web, any blast chain-detonates neighbors
		Five blasts auto-overdrive the trap into high explosive; right-click to trigger a chain check
		'''
	GsExplosiveTrapT3.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: traps placed near each other form a minefield web, any blast chain-detonates neighbors
		Overdriven blasts hurl shrapnel skyward; five blasts auto-overdrive, right-click for a chain check
		'''
	GsLightningAuraT1.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: two overlapping auras form a resonance zone dealing half again as much
		Ticks charge the aura, right-click when full to overload it wider with a static field that shocks
		'''
	GsLightningAuraT2.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: two overlapping auras form a resonance zone dealing half again as much
		Ticks charge the aura, right-click when full to overload it wider with a static field that shocks
		'''
	GsLightningAuraT3.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: overlap auras for resonance, overload adds a wider static field and shock marks
		While overdriven the aura hurls chain lightning arcing through four foes every second
		'''
	GsRainbowCrystalStaff.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: linked to any sentry, each burst refracts a prism ray into another nearby foe
		Hits charge the crystal, right-click when full to unfurl an aurora veil above it
		'''
	GsLunarPortalStaff.Desc:
		'''
		Deploy doctrine: the portal is a link hub, every sentry linked to it strikes harder
		Hits charge it, right-click when full for lunar phase volley: side lances and a rear gate
		'''

	GsOverdriveProj: {
		DisplayName: Overdrive Field
		ChargeReady: Overdrive ready
		NotReady: No sentry charged
	}

	GsSentryBurstProj.DisplayName: Sentry Burst
	GsSentryZoneProj.DisplayName: Sentry Field
	GsSentryBoltProj.DisplayName: Sentry Bolt
	GsSentryChainBlastProj.DisplayName: Chain Charge
	GsSentryChainLightningProj.DisplayName: Chain Lightning
}

GodSmithThrowing: {
	GsShuriken.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: 15% chance not to consume; crits refund one; misses stuck in walls can be picked back up
		At 5 combo stacks every throw splits off a free twin star
		'''
	GsThrowingKnife.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: crits refund one; knives stuck in walls often survive to be reclaimed
		Each hit sharpens the next knife within 0.8s, +12% up to 3 stacks
		'''
	GsPoisonedKnife.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: crits refund one; wall-stuck knives can be reclaimed
		Hits stack venom, extending poison; at 6 stacks the target corrodes, taking your knives 5 armor deeper for 8s
		'''
	GsBoneDagger.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: crits refund one; strays can be reclaimed
		Embed 4 daggers in the same foe and they all shatter for 60% each, always dropping one recovery pickup
		'''
	GsStarAnise.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: crits always refund one; strays can be reclaimed
		Ricochets to a nearby foe up to twice, losing 15% per hop
		'''
	GsBone.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the bone arcs back to your hand and deals damage both ways; catch it to reclaim it outright
		Misses can be picked back up; crits split off two half-damage shards
		'''
	GsJavelin.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: crits refund one; javelins left in walls are usually reclaimable
		Throwing while sprinting adds 25% damage and 30% velocity; consecutive hits on one target stack +12% up to 3
		'''
	GsBoneJavelin.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: crits refund one
		With 3 javelins embedded in one foe your javelins hit 15% harder; each embedded javelin has a 60% chance to drop a recovery pickup when it dies
		'''
	GsSpikyBall.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: balls that expire on the field return straight to your bag
		A foe standing on 3 or more of your balls sets off a chain spike-burst, 50% each, once per ball
		'''
	GsGrenade.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: hitting 3+ foes in one blast refunds a grenade; fuses burn 20% faster inside your combo window
		Right click for a low roll-throw with a 1.2s fuse
		'''
	GsStickyGrenade.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: blasts brand foes for 3s; branded foes take 30% more from your next blast and it always crits
		Hitting 3+ foes refunds one; right click to roll-throw
		'''
	GsBouncyGrenade.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: each bounce charges the blast +12%, up to 3 stacks
		A grenade that bounced 3 times refunds itself when its blast finds a foe; right click to roll-throw
		'''
	GsBeenade.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: bursts release 2 extra bees; stung foes take 25% more from your bees for 4s
		Hitting 3+ foes in one burst refunds one
		'''
	GsHappyGrenade.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the confetti blast leaves non-boss foes wandering confused for 1s
		Crits refund one grenade; the party never has to end
		'''
	GsMolotovCocktail.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: 25% chance not to consume; the fire pool spreads 40% wider and burns 50% longer
		Shatter another bottle on the same spot within 5s to raise a firewall that burns 30% hotter
		'''
	GsFrostDaggerfish.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: pierces one more foe; crits refund one
		Hits stack hypothermia, 3 stacks shatter for +50% and frostburn; hitting a frosted foe always drops the fish back as a pickup
		'''
	GsSnowball.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: 30% chance not to consume; each consecutive throw flies 4% faster, up to 8
		Every 8th throw packs into a great snowball: 2.5x damage and a chilling 90px burst
		'''
	GsRottenEgg.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the egg bursts into a 4s stench cloud; foes inside take 8% more damage from everything
		Crits refund one egg. It is still a rotten egg
		'''
	GsPaperAirplaneA.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the plane banks gently toward your cursor; after striking it loops back for one more pass
		Crits refund one; strays can be reclaimed
		'''
	GsPaperAirplaneB.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: the white plane banks toward your cursor and loops back after striking; +4% crit
		Crits refund one; strays can be reclaimed
		'''
	GsHolyWater.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: still hallows the land; the burst also raises a 3s radiant field
		Foes inside take 10% more from everything, allies inside mend 1 life per second; covering 3 foes refunds a flask
		'''
	GsUnholyWater.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: still corrupts the land; the burst also raises a 3s miasma
		Foes inside smolder with shadowflame and wade as if through tar
		'''
	GsBloodWater.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: still spreads the crimson; the burst also raises a 3s blood haze
		While you stand inside, your strikes leech 1 life, up to 3 per second
		'''
	GsAleTosser.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: 30% chance to not consume ale
		Hits stack Tipsy, +8% damage each up to 5; every 6th throw is a keg blast that dazes non-boss foes
		'''
	GsShadowflameKnife.Desc:
		'''
		Reforged: hits feed a combo that quickens your arm, up to 25% faster at 9 stacks
		At full combo the blade enters Flame Edge: shadowflame burns a full 4s and every 4th knife splits off a shadow clone
		'''
}

GodSmithYoyos: {
	# GodSmith mode - Yoyos family descriptions
	# Keys are composed by the framework: Mods.CalamityOverhaul.GodSmithYoyos.{SchemeClassName}.Desc
	# Every yoyo shares the same right-click orbit command, so all entries carry the same text
	
	GsWoodYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: anchor, the yoyo patrols in place at your cursor
		Anchored hits on the same target build Heat, up to +40% damage
		Every 4th anchored hit flings 2 spinning wood chips at 25% damage
		'''
	GsRallyYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: anchor patrol
		Every 5 anchored hits quicken the strike tempo, up to 3 ranks; ranks reset when the yoyo returns
		'''
	GsMalaiseYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: anchor patrol
		A field of malaise around the anchor slows enemies by 8%
		'''
	GsArteryYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: anchor patrol
		Anchored hits have a 20% chance to fling a blood bead dealing 15% damage
		'''
	GsAmazonYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: anchor patrol
		Anchored hits inflict Poisoned; at full Heat the poison lasts twice as long
		At full Heat the yoyo also sprouts a venom vine, lashing the nearest foe for 20% damage every 0.75s
		'''
	GsCode1Yoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: single tap to anchor, double tap to lash back through foes (2.2x speed, 135% damage)
		A lash hit sets a Breakpoint on the target for 3s: anchored hits on it deal 30% more
		'''
	GsValorYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: tap to anchor, double tap to lash
		Lash knockback is doubled; with 3 or more enemies near the anchor, anchored damage gains 15%
		'''
	GsCascadeYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: tap to anchor, double tap to lash
		Hits shed cascading sparks; the lash path leaves burning lines behind
		'''
	GsHiveFiveYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: tap to anchor, double tap to lash
		While anchored the yoyo becomes a hive, releasing a bee every 0.8s; bees benefit from your bee equipment
		'''
	GsFormatCYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: tap to anchor, double tap to lash
		A lash hit formats the target's Heat straight to full; 6s cooldown, a white star marks it ready
		'''
	GsGradientYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: tap to anchor, double tap to lash
		Heat cap raised to +60%; the yoyo shifts gold, orange then red as Heat builds
		'''
	GsChikYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: tap to anchor, double tap to lash
		The lash flies at 2.6x speed with a sonic ring on launch
		'''
	GsHelFireYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: tap to anchor, double tap to lash
		Every 2s the anchor ignites the ground below with a ring of hellfire
		'''
	GsAmarokYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: tap to anchor, double tap to lash, hold to orbit
		The orbit trails frost mist, slowing enemies in the domain by 12% (spin time drains faster while orbiting)
		'''
	GsCode2Yoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: tap to anchor, double tap to lash, hold to orbit
		The lash splits a parallel mirror track 40px aside, dealing 50% damage
		'''
	GsYeletsYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: tap to anchor, double tap to lash, hold to orbit
		Every 6 anchored hits fling a ring of 8 spores, each dealing 40% damage
		'''
	GsRedsThrowYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: tap to anchor, double tap to lash, hold to orbit
		A lash hit loads 3 Red Flags into the target; while flags remain, anchored hits on it are guaranteed crits, one flag per hit
		'''
	GsValkyrieYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: tap to anchor, double tap to lash, hold to orbit
		The orbit tilts into a valkyrie's gyre, shedding feather light on hits
		'''
	GsKrakenYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: tap to anchor, double tap to lash, hold to orbit
		While anchored, inky tendrils lash the two nearest foes for 30% damage per pulse
		Infinite spin time makes it a true siege core
		'''
	GsEyeOfCthulhuYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click: tap to anchor, double tap to lash, hold to orbit
		The anchor stares down the nearest foe, spitting 3 blood tears every 2s; the lash becomes a ramming charge dealing 160% damage
		'''
	GsTerrarianYoyo.Desc:
		'''
		Right click taps: chart up to 3 waypoints, the yoyo patrols the bezier route and its beam rate doubles while patrolling
		Each completed lap rings a Patrol Resonance: for 1s beams fire faster and 30% harder
		Double tap to lash, hold to orbit; click again when the route is full to clear it
		'''
}

